e; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"1\"><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"3\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"5\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"4\">1</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"7\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"6\">2</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"8\">x</var><span class=\"mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"10\"><span class=\"mq-scaled mq-sqrt-prefix\" style=\"transform: scale(1, 1.18824);\">√</span><span class=\"mq-non-leaf mq-sqrt-stem\" mathquill-block-id=\"12\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"11\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"13\" class=\"mq-binary-operator\">+</span><span class=\"mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"15\"><span class=\"mq-scaled mq-sqrt-prefix\" style=\"transform: scale(1, 0.995008);\">√</span><span class=\"mq-non-leaf mq-sqrt-stem\" mathquill-block-id=\"17\"><var mathquill-command-id=\"16\">x</var></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosecant function is\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"